OL,3,AConvicted Bosnian Serb war criminal
OL,4,AMladiDG dies aged 84
OL,5,
OL,6,FConvicted Bosnian Serb war criminal
OL,7,FRatko MladiDG has died in a UN prison
OL,8,Fat The Hague aged 84. News of his death
OL,9,Fwas confirmed by a UN official.
OL,11,FMladiDG was jailed for life in 2017 for
OL,12,Fgenocide, war crimes and crimes against
OL,13,Fhumanity during the wars in the former
OL,14,FYugoslavia between 1992 and 1995.
OL,16,FAfter the Bosnian war, MladiDG went on
OL,17,Fthe run for 16 years until he was
OL,18,Ffinally tracked down in rural Serbia in
OL,19,F2011 and put on trial at The Hague.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
