OL,3,AConvicted Bosnian Serb war criminal
OL,4,AMladiDG dies aged 84
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe sentence for the man known as the
OL,7,F"Butcher of Bosnia" was upheld on
OL,8,Fappeal in 2021. He was being given
OL,9,Fpalliative care in the hospital of the
OL,10,FUN jail at The Hague, where he died.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
